cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DFlash K=15 for Qwen3.5-4B on a single A10G"
message: "If you refer to this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Praveen A.
    family-names: Shukla
    affiliation: "Mohamed bin Zayed University of Artificial Intelligence"
  - given-names: Noel
    family-names: Thomas
    affiliation: "Mohamed bin Zayed University of Artificial Intelligence"
abstract: >-
  Writeup and configuration for team AFM-qd39x2e6, which placed sixth in the
  Efficient LLM Challenge at the AdaptFM workshop, ICML 2026. Serves
  Qwen3.5-4B on one NVIDIA A10G at a 5.366x mean latency speedup using a
  4-bit AWQ target with DFlash speculative decoding at K=15, passing the
  MMLU-Pro, IFEval and GPQA-Diamond quality gates. Includes the submissions
  that failed and why.
keywords:
  - speculative decoding
  - LLM inference
  - vLLM
  - quantization
  - Qwen3.5
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/PraveenAShukla/adaptfm"
date-released: "2026-08-01"
